# Keyed runs against the testnet profile (my-stack: keyed runs): the L1 deploy, the miner deploy and the
# operator's bridge writes. Secrets resolve from 1Password on the owner's Mac; a .env with values never exists.
# The L1 RPC must stay a public node: l1-deploy.ts writes its origin into the committed record.
# op: generate eth-key
YACANA_L1_PRIVATE_KEY=op://Keyed-Runs/Yacana-Testnet/YACANA_L1_PRIVATE_KEY
# op: generate hex32
YACANA_DEPLOYER_SECRET=op://Keyed-Runs/Yacana-Testnet/YACANA_DEPLOYER_SECRET
YACANA_L1_RPC_URL=https://ethereum-sepolia-rpc.publicnode.com
AZTEC_NODE_URL=https://v5.testnet.rpc.aztec-labs.com
YACANA_REGISTRY=0xa0bfb1b494fb49041e5c6e8c2c1be09cd171c6ba
